.TH SDL_HINT_JOYSTICK_HIDAPI_8BITDO 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_JOYSTICK_HIDAPI_8BITDO \- A variable controlling whether the HIDAPI driver for 8BitDo controllers should be used.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_JOYSTICK_HIDAPI_8BITDO \(dqSDL_JOYSTICK_HIDAPI_8BITDO\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The variable can be set to the following values:
.PP

\(bu \(dq0\(dq: HIDAPI driver is not used\[char46]
.PP
\(bu \(dq1\(dq: HIDAPI driver is used\[char46]
.PP
The default is the value of
.BR SDL_HINT_JOYSTICK_HIDAPI \[char46]
.PP
This hint should be set before initializing joysticks and gamepads\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

